y Air", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "When you travel by airplane there are many words to listen for.  The ticket agent takes your luggage at the check-in counter. Heavy bags often have an overweight charge.  <br><br> A carry-on is 23 cm by 40 cm by 55 cm. Larger carry-ons have to be weighed and checked.<br><Br>First class customers can have more luggage. They wait in a special lounge with free tea, coffee and snacks.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\"> Ticket Agent</span>: Please put your luggage on the scale. <BR><span class=\"strong\">Traveler</span>: Here they are. <br><span class=\"strong\">Ticket Agent</span>: Your bags are heavy. There is a $100 overweight charge. <br><span class=\"strong\">Traveler</span> : $100!? <br> <span class=\"strong\">Ticket Agent</span>: Your carry-on is large as well. You need to check it too. That's $150 in total. <br><span class=\"strong\"> Traveler</span>: Oh my gosh!", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "passenger list", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a list of people booked to fly by an airline at a specific time", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You are not on the passenger list.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le09ob03aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": " Use these words when you check-in at the airport.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "counter", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a desk in a bank, store or an airport", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Is this the counter for United Airlines?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le09ob03aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "airline", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a business that carries passengers or goods by air", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: What airline did you travel with?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le09ob03aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "carry-on", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a small bag you can take onto the plane", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Put your carry-on under the seat, please.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le09ob03aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "porter ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a person to carry your bags in an airport or train station", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: This porter will help you with your bags, Ma'am.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le09ob03aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "scale", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a device for weighing", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Please place your luggage on the scale.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le09ob03aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "overweight charge", "type": "name"}, {"content": "extra money for heavy bags", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Your bags are heavy. There might be an overweight charge.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le09ob03aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"content": "engenn3le09ob03re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Think of ways first-class plane travel is different from economy.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Ask your partner to do the same.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Look at the chart. Fill in each area.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Tell a partner your ideas.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Listen to your partner's ideas.", 